ainst a holder in due course of a negotiable instrument under Section 3–305(b). (d) [Omission of required statement in consumer transaction.] In a consumer transaction, if a record evidences the account debtor’s obli- gation, law other than this article requires that the record include a state- ment to the effect that the rights of an assignee are subject to claims or § 9–310 UNIFORM COMMERCIAL CODE"